OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 80s seriously injured after
OL,4,Abeing hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has suffered serious
OL,7,Finjuries after being hit by a bus.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to Melton Road,
OL,11,FQueniborough, at about 15:35 BST on
OL,12,FMonday following a crash involving a
OL,13,Fpedestrian and a bus.
OL,15,FThe force said the man remains in
OL,16,Fhospital. His next of kin have been
OL,17,Finformed and are being supported.
OL,19,FNo other injuries have been reported
OL,20,Fand no arrests have been made.
